concept:c2022a00048-sch-1-sec-25 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25 After subsection 97(1)"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sch-1-sec-25 ;
    values:originalText "Insert:  (2) A person must not be appointed as the Sex Discrimination Commissioner under section 96 for a period if the sum of the following exceeds 7 years:  (a) that period;  (b) any periods of previous appointment of the person as the Sex Discrimination Commissioner under that section." ;
    skos:definition "Insert:  (2) A person must not be appointed as the Sex Discrimination Commissioner under section 96 for a period if the sum of the following exceeds 7 years:  (a) that period;  (b) any periods of previous appointment of the person as the Sex Discrimination Commissioner under that section."@en ;
